  "guideContent": {
    "strategyOverview": "Bant token engine that exploits Donatello's replacement effect — every token you create also produces a Mutagen artifact. Leonardo puts +1/+1 counters on each creature whenever a token enters, building a wide and tall board simultaneously. Token doublers like Parallel Lives and Anointed Procession multiply both the original tokens AND the bonus Mutagens exponentially. Academy Manufactor converts any Food, Clue, or Treasure into all three types, each triggering Donatello for additional Mutagens. The deck finishes games through Cyberdrive Awakener (turning Mutagen artifacts into 4/4 flyers), Herald of Secret Streams (making all countered creatures unblockable), or Cyclonic Rift into an alpha strike with the token army."
  },
